```Query 6: Detect Ransomware Behaviour
EventCode 4663 records file access. One user changing 200+ files in one minute is malware, not a human.```
index=security EventCode=4663 Object_Type=File
| bin _time span=1m
| stats count AS file_ops BY _time, user, host
| where file_ops > 200
| sort -file_ops
| table _time, host, user, file_ops
